  "description": "<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"f89b2ad0-de1a-46cb-9db3-a66af92c1302\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-2\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"52\" data-end=\"545\"><strong data-start=\"52\" data-end=\"79\">Spyro Reignited Trilogy</strong> is een kleurrijke en nostalgische <strong data-start=\"114\" data-end=\"137\">actie-/platformgame</strong> voor de Nintendo Switch waarin drie klassieke Spyro-avonturen volledig zijn geremasterd. Je beleeft <em data-start=\"238\" data-end=\"256\">Spyro the Dragon</em>, <em data-start=\"258\" data-end=\"282\">Spyro 2: Ripto’s Rage!</em> en <em data-start=\"286\" data-end=\"313\">Spyro: Year of the Dragon</em> in één bundel, met verbeterde graphics, vloeiende gameplay en dezelfde charme als het origineel. De game biedt een perfecte mix van verkenning, platformactie en humor, geschikt voor zowel nieuwe spelers als fans van het eerste uur.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"547\" data-end=\"626\">De game verkeert in <strong data-start=\"567\" data-end=\"585\">In Nette Staat</strong>, is volledig getest en direct speelbaar.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"628\" data-end=\"631\">\r\n<p data-start=\"633\" data-end=\"648\">⭐ <strong data-start=\"635\" data-end=\"648\">Voordelen</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"649\" data-end=\"849\">\r\n<li data-start=\"649\" data-end=\"695\">\r\n<p data-start=\"651\" data-end=\"695\">🐉 Drie complete Spyro-games in één bundel</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"696\" data-end=\"746\">\r\n<p data-start=\"698\" data-end=\"746\">🎨 Volledig geremasterde graphics en animaties</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"747\" data-end=\"803\">\r\n<p data-start=\"749\" data-end=\"803\">🕹️ Toegankelijke platformgameplay met veel variatie</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"849\">\r\n<p data-start=\"806\" data-end=\"849\">👨‍👩‍👧‍👦 Geschikt voor alle leeftijden</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"851\" data-end=\"854\">\r\n<p data-start=\"856\" data-end=\"876\">📋 <strong data-start=\"859\" data-end=\"876\">Specificaties</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"877\" data-end=\"1061\">\r\n<li data-start=\"877\" data-end=\"906\">\r\n<p data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"906\">Platform: Nintendo Switch</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"907\" data-end=\"941\">\r\n<p data-start=\"909\" data-end=\"941\">Titel: Spyro Reignited Trilogy</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"969\">\r\n<p data-start=\"944\" data-end=\"969\">Genre: Actie / Platform</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"997\">\r\n<p data-start=\"972\" data-end=\"997\">Spelmodus: Singleplayer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1035\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1000\" data-end=\"1035\">Taal: Engels (menu’s en gameplay)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1036\" data-end=\"1061\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1061\">Staat: In Nette Staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1066\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1068\" data-end=\"1086\">📦 <strong data-start=\"1071\" data-end=\"1086\">Meegeleverd</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1087\" data-end=\"1124\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1087\" data-end=\"1124\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1124\">Nintendo Switch game <strong data-start=\"1110\" data-end=\"1124\">met doosje</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1126\" data-end=\"1129\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1131\" data-end=\"1192\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">🛡️ <strong data-start=\"1135\" data-end=\"1153\">Incl. Garantie</strong><br data-start=\"1153\" data-end=\"1156\">Incl. Garantie: <strong data-start=\"1172\" data-end=\"1192\" data-is-last-node=\"\">1 maand garantie</strong></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"border-token-border-light my-2 flex gap-10 border-t pt-4\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden h-12 w-12 rounded-lg\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"> </div>",
